WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.700
Every trace starts at the thinnest width, 0.25 millimetres.

2
00:00:05.726 --> 00:00:08.301
Thin traces are fine for signals.

3
00:00:09.129 --> 00:00:11.579
But a big current heats a thin trace.

4
00:00:12.532 --> 00:00:14.532
So the current sets the width.
